approximation is used in 1811.03474 and 2112.09814. For the dedicated mixing with the given meson \
\!\(\*SuperscriptBox[\(m\), \(0\)]\), it is inaccurate in the domains \!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(m\), \
\(a\)]\) ~ \!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(m\), SuperscriptBox[\(m\), \(0'\)]]\)\""}], ";",
